## Component Patterns

### Card

```svelte
<!-- Standard glassmorphic card -->
<div class="bg-glass border border-border rounded-2xl p-4">
  ...
</div>

<!-- Elevated card with accent highlight -->
<div class="bg-bg2 border border-border rounded-2xl p-4
            shadow-[0_0_40px_-10px_rgba(70,33,255,0.3)]">
  ...
</div>

<!-- Active / selected card -->
<div class="bg-blue-dim border border-blue/30 rounded-2xl p-4">
  ...
</div>
```

