## Layout & Spacing

The app is a **mobile-first Capacitor app**. All screens use:

```svelte
<!-- Standard page shell -->
<div class="flex flex-col h-full bg-bg0 text-text0 overflow-y-auto">
  <!-- content -->
</div>
```

- Base spacing unit: `4px` (Tailwind `gap-1`, `p-1`, etc.)
- Cards inside a page: `p-4` internal padding, `gap-3` between cards
- Section-level spacing: `mb-6` between major sections
- Safe area: use `pb-safe` / `pt-safe` on root containers for notch/home-bar clearance

---

## Chart / Data Visualization

Using **LayerChart** (D3-backed SVG). Key conventions:

- Area charts: gradient fill using `LinearGradient` with accent color at `opacity: 0.25` → `0`
- Line strokes: `strokeWidth={2}`, accent color
- Axis ticks: `font-mono`, `text-text2`, `text-[10px]`
- Always DPR-scale canvas elements manually (`devicePixelRatio`)
- Metric-to-color mapping:
  - HRV / Recovery → `--teal`
  - CTL (fitness) → `--blue`
  - ATL (fatigue) → `--amber`
  - TSB (form) → dynamic: positive → `--teal`, negative → `--red`
  - HR / effort → `--red`

